      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1942230606701560201",
      "text": "[3:30PM] #OkeOdo #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement is smooth from Awori U-turn inward Abule Egba, passing under the Jubilee Bridge towards Oja Oba and onward to the Charity intersection. Traffic continues to flow well through Charity Road, providing easy access to Social Club Road and Olayiwola.\n\nMovement from the Jubilee Bridge inward Super, through Ile Epo, down to Pleasure in both directions, remains in good condition. Similarly, the route from Abule Egba inward to Ahmadiyya, Ijaiye, Meiran, Adura, Carso, Kola, Moshalashi, and Alakuko down to Ajegunle en route to Toll Gate is clear and free-flowing.\n\nThe return journey from Ajegunle through Kola down to Ijaiye and back to Abule Egba is also moving freely. No impediments have been reported, and our officers remain actively present to maintain order and ensure seamless movement.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
